\date{2025-10-26T01:45:51Z}
\title{Swarm}

\p{In the fall of 2021 I started developing a game called [Swarm](http://github.com/swarm-game/swarm) and built a small open-source community around its development.  So far we have made a
few [official alpha releases](https://github.com/swarm-game/swarm/releases/tag/0.8.0.0), and development continues to hum along.  Now that the most recent release (0.8) is out the door, I am working hard on adding an [import feature](https://github.com/swarm-game/swarm/pull/2540) to the language---it's getting close to being merged. I've also been writing up some notes about a planned [redesign of the type system](000U).}
